<section style="background: rgb(223, 221, 208); padding: 72px 24px;"><div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Customer Care</p><h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 34px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 400;">Shipping &amp; Returns</h1><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px; max-width: 620px;">How we pack, ship and look after your order, and what to do if something isn't right.</p></div></section>
<section style="padding: 72px 24px;"><div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 42px 72px; align-items: flex-start;"><nav aria-label="Policies" style="flex: 1 1 220px; max-width: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><a href="/pages/shipping-and-returns" aria-current="page" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px; text-decoration: underline;">Shipping &amp; Returns</a><a href="/pages/klarna-payments" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Klarna Payments</a><a href="/pages/payment-terms-conditions" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Payment Terms</a><a href="/pages/privacy-policy" style="padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Privacy Policy</a></nav><div style="flex: 3 1 560px; min-width: 0px; max-width: 760px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 42px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Last updated November 2026</p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 42px;"><div style="flex: 1 1 200px; background: rgb(223, 221, 208); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Processing</span><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px;">1-3 business days</span></div><div style="flex: 1 1 200px; background: rgb(223, 221, 208); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">We ship to</span><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px;">United States &amp; Mexico</span></div><div style="flex: 1 1 200px; background: rgb(223, 221, 208); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 16.8px;">Free shipping</span><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px;">US orders $150+</span></div></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Order Processing</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Every bottle is hand-packaged in glass, so orders leave our studio within 1-3 business days. During launches and holidays, please allow a little extra time. You will receive a confirmation email with tracking as soon as your order ships.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Shipping Rates &amp; Delivery</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">We currently ship within the United States and to Mexico. Rates and estimated delivery times are shown at checkout before you pay.</p><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 10px;"><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;"><span>United States, orders $150+</span><span>Free standard shipping</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;"><span>United States, Standard (5–7 business days)</span><span>$8.95</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;"><span>United States, Express (2–3 business days)</span><span>$19.95</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;"><span>United States, Overnight (next business day)</span><span>$39.95</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;"><span>Mexico</span><span>Calculated at checkout, in MXN</span></div></div><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">Orders to Mexico may be subject to import duties or taxes, which are the responsibility of the recipient.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Returns</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">For hygiene reasons, we can accept returns of unopened, unused products in their original packaging within 30 days of delivery. To start a return, send us a note through our <a href="/pages/contact-us" style="text-decoration: underline;">Contact page</a> with your order number and we will share the next steps.</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Opened products, bundles that have been opened, and items bought on final sale cannot be returned.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Refunds</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Once your return arrives and is inspected, we will email you and refund your original payment method. Refunds usually appear within 5-10 business days, depending on your bank. If you paid with Klarna, your refund is applied to your Klarna balance and your payment plan is updated automatically.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Damaged or Incorrect Items</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Glass travels well with us, but if anything arrives broken or isn't what you ordered, contact us within 7 days of delivery with your order number and a photo. We will send a replacement or issue a refund at no cost to you.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px 0px 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;"><h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 23px; line-height: 32.2px; font-weight: 400;">Subscriptions</h2><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px;">Subscription orders ship on your chosen schedule, every month or every 3 months. You can skip or cancel anytime from your account before your next order is processed.</p></div><div style="margin-top: 60px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 42px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px;"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px;">Still have questions?</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 19.6px;">We usually reply within 1-2 business days.</span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px;"><a href="/pages/contact-us" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; background: rgb(88, 81, 40); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;">Contact Us</a><a href="/pages/faqs" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 50px; padding: 0px 24px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box;">Read the FAQ</a></div></div></div></div></section>
